<title>USA: Santa Anita to review Koll/Colony plan.</title>
<headline>Santa Anita to review Koll/Colony plan.</headline>
<dateline>ARCADIA, Cal. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Santa Anita Cos said Monday they would evaluate the proposal received from Koll Arcadia Investors LLC and Colony Investors II LP, with its special committees of independent directors and Santa Andita's financial advisors.</p>
<p>Santa Anita said it will also evaluate other strategic alternatives.</p>
<p>Earlier on Monday, Koll and Colony proposed to recapitalize the real estate investment trust by providing $116.5 million in equity capital, in return for control of the company.</p>
</text>
